WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.677 --> 00:00:01.931
- I think I still need to do my taxes,

00:00:01.931 --> 00:00:03.255
is it April 15th that --

00:00:03.255 --> 00:00:05.664
- It's April 15th, but if you mail them,

00:00:05.664 --> 00:00:07.620
then it's gonna take a while
so you gotta do it like --

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:10.963
- I'm Milo, that's Moe, and this is Paul,

00:00:10.963 --> 00:00:12.542
our fun-loving and not-as-responsible

00:00:12.542 --> 00:00:14.317
best friend and roommate.

00:00:14.317 --> 00:00:16.319
He's also two years younger
than the both of us,

00:00:16.319 --> 00:00:17.501
and it shows.

00:00:17.501 --> 00:00:18.314
Paul!

00:00:18.314 --> 00:00:20.863
(lighthearted music)

00:00:26.364 --> 00:00:28.785
He knows about new stuff on
the internet way before we do.

00:00:28.785 --> 00:00:29.953
- What is Damn Daniel?

00:00:29.953 --> 00:00:30.853
- It's a meme.

00:00:30.853 --> 00:00:31.873
- What the hell is a meme?

00:00:31.873 --> 00:00:32.901
- Can't explain a meme.

00:00:32.901 --> 00:00:34.149
- What?

00:00:34.149 --> 00:00:35.728
- [Milo] And knows nothing about

00:00:35.728 --> 00:00:37.005
real-world stuff that matters.

00:00:37.005 --> 00:00:38.468
- Did you even file your taxes, man?

00:00:38.468 --> 00:00:39.140
- No.

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:40.651
- Are you going to?

00:00:40.651 --> 00:00:41.951
- Do I need to?

00:00:41.951 --> 00:00:43.993
- Short answer: yes,
long answer: yes, Paul.

00:00:43.993 --> 00:00:45.085
File your taxes.

00:00:45.085 --> 00:00:46.316
God love him.

00:00:46.316 --> 00:00:47.926
I mean he really just doesn't know.

00:00:47.926 --> 00:00:50.564
- What even is a 401(k)?

00:00:50.564 --> 00:00:53.077
- [Milo] Sometimes he does
stuff that I find immature.

00:00:53.077 --> 00:00:54.099
Come on guys.

00:00:54.099 --> 00:00:55.028
- [Paul] What floor are we going to?

00:00:55.028 --> 00:00:55.762
- [Moe] Four.

00:00:55.762 --> 00:00:57.942
- I think it's the fourth.

00:00:57.942 --> 00:01:00.894
No! Paul, why would you --

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:02.527
- [Paul] I'm having fun, I dunno.

00:01:02.527 --> 00:01:03.987
- [Milo] And he has way more energy

00:01:03.987 --> 00:01:05.868
than me and Moe combined.

00:01:05.868 --> 00:01:07.519
I mean the boy can skate all day.

00:01:07.519 --> 00:01:08.388
All day!

00:01:10.668 --> 00:01:12.736
Moe tends to treat him
like a little brother.

00:01:12.736 --> 00:01:14.772
- All I'm saying is that at some point

00:01:14.772 --> 00:01:17.379
you're gonna like a girl,
she might like you back.

00:01:17.379 --> 00:01:18.544
- I like playing girls.

00:01:18.544 --> 00:01:20.751
- [Milo] But it's because
he's still so youthful.

00:01:20.751 --> 00:01:21.982
Can I get a coffee?

00:01:21.982 --> 00:01:24.413
- Yeah, let me get a cappuccino.

00:01:24.413 --> 00:01:26.285
- Orange soda for me, please.

00:01:26.285 --> 00:01:28.858
- [Milo] Speaking of, he hates
being treated like a baby.

00:01:28.858 --> 00:01:30.714
- That's kinda how it works, young bull.

00:01:30.714 --> 00:01:33.423
Little man with a plan (laughs).

00:01:33.423 --> 00:01:34.436
Grow up, Peter Pan.

00:01:34.436 --> 00:01:35.445
- Okay, can you stop it?

00:01:35.445 --> 00:01:36.655
- I'm just saying.

00:01:36.655 --> 00:01:38.917
- [Milo] But we are the only
ones allowed to baby him.

00:01:38.917 --> 00:01:41.379
- I don't think so, little guy (laughs)

00:01:41.379 --> 00:01:43.166
- Hey man, don't talk to him like that.

00:01:43.166 --> 00:01:44.456
- Yeah, don't do that.

00:01:44.456 --> 00:01:45.604
- I'm so sorry, I didn't--

00:01:45.604 --> 00:01:46.473
- You okay?

00:01:46.473 --> 00:01:47.243
- Yeah.

00:01:47.243 --> 00:01:48.924
- [Milo] Sometimes my
girlfriends are into him

00:01:48.924 --> 00:01:50.689
and that is weird.

00:01:50.689 --> 00:01:53.078
- So tell me about Paul, is he single?

00:01:53.078 --> 00:01:55.516
- Oh girl, he is a baby.

00:01:55.516 --> 00:01:57.271
But it's not bad being the youngest,

00:01:57.271 --> 00:01:58.671
you've got your whole
life ahead of you and

00:01:58.671 --> 00:02:01.457
people are gonna look out for you.

00:02:01.457 --> 00:02:03.700
Well, at least your friends will.

00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:05.647
(lighthearted music)

